{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 114,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        231.10589599609375,
        21.884788513183594,
        277.722412109375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.722412109375,
        21.884788513183594,
        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        83.11911010742188,
        510.57598876953125,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "Use of tuberculosis interferon-gamma release assays (IGRAs) in low- and  Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        96.91909790039062,
        510.5644226074219,
        110.339599609375
      ],
      "text": "middle-income countries: Policy statement.  Geneva, World Health Organization,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        110.7880859375,
        251.82591247558594,
        124.13958740234375
      ],
      "text": "2011 (WHO/HTM/TB/2011.18)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        132.5115966796875,
        238.85391235351562,
        146.13909912109375
      ],
      "text": "Summary of recent evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        151.62457275390625,
        510.5990295410156,
        164.97607421875
      ],
      "text": "The Panel considered recent published data, including original studies and systematic",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        167.62109375,
        510.58746337890625,
        180.97259521484375
      ],
      "text": "reviews. Four recently published systematic reviews included studies that evaluated",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        183.61761474609375,
        510.5874938964844,
        196.9691162109375
      ],
      "text": "IGRAs in children in the context of TB infection and disease. The reference test was",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        199.54513549804688,
        510.5529479980469,
        212.96563720703125
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis TST. The “gold standard” for diagnosis of TB disease was   culture",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        215.61065673828125,
        510.6219482421875,
        228.962158203125
      ],
      "text": "confirmation. Studies reviewed reported low numbers of culture confirmed, and some",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        231.607177734375,
        510.57598876953125,
        244.95867919921875
      ],
      "text": "studies included a clinical “probable” TB diagnosis for comparison. There was marked",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        247.60369873046875,
        510.61041259765625,
        260.9552001953125
      ],
      "text": "heterogeneity of methodology between studies that further limited comparability",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        263.6002197265625,
        510.598876953125,
        276.95172119140625
      ],
      "text": "and interpretation of results. Indeterminate results were especially common in young",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        279.59674072265625,
        510.63348388671875,
        292.9482421875
      ],
      "text": "children. Most studies have been done in the high-resource, low-TB-burden setting",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        295.59326171875,
        510.656494140625,
        308.94476318359375
      ],
      "text": "and there are limited data from children with HIV infection or severe malnutrition.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        311.58978271484375,
        510.55303955078125,
        324.9412841796875
      ],
      "text": "Overall, IGRAs had similar accuracy to TST in children with TB infection and disease,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        327.5862731933594,
        495.4880065917969,
        340.9377746582031
      ],
      "text": "with methodological limitations of interpretation and comparison being recognized.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        352.0927734375,
        510.5643005371094,
        365.44427490234375
      ],
      "text": "Studies that were not included in these systematic reviews because they have been",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        368.0892639160156,
        510.5644836425781,
        381.4407653808594
      ],
      "text": "published more recently were subject to the same limitations of heterogeneous",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        384.08575439453125,
        510.6449890136719,
        397.437255859375
      ],
      "text": "methodology, small numbers of confirmed cases for disease, and high numbers of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        400.0822448730469,
        194.08438110351562,
        413.4337463378906
      ],
      "text": "indeterminate results.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        424.5887451171875,
        510.5414123535156,
        437.94024658203125
      ],
      "text": "The largest and highest-quality of the recent studies was conducted in a setting of high",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        440.5852355957031,
        510.5414123535156,
        453.9367370605469
      ],
      "text": "TB burden; it reported a low sensitivity of the commercial IGRA evaluated, even in cases",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        456.58172607421875,
        510.62200927734375,
        469.9332275390625
      ],
      "text": "with confirmed disease, and lower sensitivity than TST. It is consistently clear that a",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        472.5782165527344,
        510.6565246582031,
        485.9297180175781
      ],
      "text": "negative IGRA, like a negative TST, cannot exclude TB disease. The consistent findings",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        488.57470703125,
        510.54144287109375,
        501.92620849609375
      ],
      "text": "from review of data in children published since the original recommendations were",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        504.57122802734375,
        507.4250183105469,
        517.9227294921875
      ],
      "text": "considered and the Panel agreed to revise the quality of evidence from very low to low.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        528.8016967773438,
        198.13243103027344,
        542.42919921875
      ],
      "text": "Other considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        547.9147338867188,
        510.6103515625,
        561.2662353515625
      ],
      "text": "Like TST, IGRAs are able to indicate infection and are not a diagnostic test for disease.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        563.9111938476562,
        351.7035217285156,
        577.2626953125
      ],
      "text": "The reference test is TST - and TST also has limitations.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        588.4176635742188,
        510.587646484375,
        601.7691650390625
      ],
      "text": "IGRAs are expensive and technically challenging, requiring sophisticated laboratory",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        604.4141845703125,
        510.58734130859375,
        617.7656860351562
      ],
      "text": "support. Even in the context of research, it was reported that the tests are technically",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        620.4107055664062,
        510.6219177246094,
        633.76220703125
      ],
      "text": "difficult to implement and that indeterminate results are common. Technical difficulties",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        636.4072265625,
        510.54150390625,
        649.7587280273438
      ],
      "text": "were reported by Panel members with experience of using IGRAs in low-income settings,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        652.4037475585938,
        215.6009063720703,
        665.7552490234375
      ],
      "text": "even in a research context.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        676.9102172851562,
        510.55303955078125,
        690.26171875
      ],
      "text": "Limited data are available from children in TB-endemic settings, especially from key",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        692.90673828125,
        488.28900146484375,
        706.2582397460938
      ],
      "text": "populations with diagnostic challenges, i.e. young, HIV-positive and malnourished.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        717.13720703125,
        161.72341918945312,
        730.7647094726562
      ],
      "text": "Panel decision",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        736.250244140625,
        510.56451416015625,
        749.6017456054688
      ],
      "text": "Endorsed, but the quality of the evidence was changed from very low to low because of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        752.2467041015625,
        469.4979248046875,
        765.5982055664062
      ],
      "text": "consistent findings in recent studies that IGRAs have lower sensitivity than TST.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "95",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}